rule jaar_gebonden_budget_1 with provenance the model at decision Jaar Gebonden Budget:
the plafond eigenaren of the jaar gebonden budget is a number if
    the date written as the aanvraag datum is a date
    and the year of the date is a second number
    and the jaar gebonden budget for the second number is the number with a third number under table jaar_gebonden_budget.

