the plafond huurders of the jaar gebonden budget is a number if
    the date written as the aanvraag datum is a date
    and the year of the date is a second number
    and the jaar gebonden budget for the second number is a third number with the number under table jaar_gebonden_budget.

rule recht_op_subsidie_thuisbatterij_1 with provenance the model at decision Recht op subsidie thuisbatterij:
the recht op subsidie of the recht op subsidie thuisbatterij is a truth value if
