    otherwise the aanvrager failliet is false
    and the provincie woning two is "Flevoland"
    and the relatie tot woning two is "huurder"
    and the toestemming eigenaar two is false
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise the rekening naam komt overeen is false
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise the aanvrager failliet is false
