    and the truth value is equal to true
    otherwise the truth value is equal to false.

rule recht_op_subsidie_thuisbatterij_2 with provenance the model at decision Recht op subsidie thuisbatterij:
the reden of the recht op subsidie thuisbatterij is a text if
    the aanvrager failliet is true
    and the text is equal to "Aanvrager is failliet"
    otherwise the aanvrager failliet is false
    and it is not the case that the provincie woning two is a second text
    and the text is equal to "Woning ligt niet in Flevoland"
    otherwise the aanvrager failliet is false
    and the provincie woning two is a third text
    and the third text is not equal to "Flevoland"
    and the text is equal to "Woning ligt niet in Flevoland"
    otherwise the aanvrager failliet is false
    and the provincie woning two is "Flevoland"
    and it is not the case that the relatie tot woning two is a fourth text
    and the text is equal to "Aanvrager is geen eigenaar of huurder"
    otherwise the aanvrager failliet is false
    and the provincie woning two is "Flevoland"
    and the relatie tot woning two is a fifth text
    and the fifth text is not equal to "eigenaar"
    and the fifth text is not equal to "huurder"
    and the text is equal to "Aanvrager is geen eigenaar of huurder"
    otherwise the aanvrager failliet is false
    and the provincie woning two is "Flevoland"
    and the relatie tot woning two is "huurder"
    and the toestemming eigenaar two is false
    and the text is equal to "Huurder heeft geen toestemming van eigenaar"
    otherwise the rekening naam komt overeen is false
    and the text is equal to "Aanvrager staat niet op de energierekening"
    otherwise the aanvrager failliet is false
    and the provincie woning two is "Flevoland"
    and the relatie tot woning two is "eigenaar"
    and the rekening naam komt overeen is true
    and the text is equal to "Aanvrager heeft recht op subsidie"
    otherwise the aanvrager failliet is false
    and the provincie woning two is "Flevoland"
    and the relatie tot woning two is "huurder"
    and the toestemming eigenaar two is true
    and the rekening naam komt overeen is true
    and the text is equal to "Aanvrager heeft recht op subsidie; huurder met toestemming eigenaar"
